      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تواطح القَوْمُ</span></b>  <i>The people did evil,</i> or <i>mischief, one to another, by turns:</i> or <i>fought
together.</i> (El-Umawee, S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تواطحت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِبِلُ عَلَى الحَوْضِ</span>, (TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تواطحت الحَوْضَ</span>,
(K,) <i>The camels crowded,</i> or <i>pressed together, to
the tank</i> or <i>cistern.</i> (K.)

